' Rejected: legacy PlantUML activity syntax.
' The pre-beta "(*) --> :task; --> (*)" form with `-->` arrows and
' `(*)` start/end circles still renders in PlantUML but is
' deprecated. We accept only the current "start / stop / :task;"
' subset so our parser has one target, not two.
' Rewrite: see 01-linear.puml for the modern equivalent.
@startuml
(*) --> :申込を受付;
--> :内容を審査;
--> :結果を通知;
--> (*)
@enduml
